{"id":"besiegt","lemma":"besiegt","pos":"adj","rank":2401,"glosses":["defeated"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a0/De-besiegt.ogg/De-besiegt.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Wir wurden besiegt.","en":"We've been defeated.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},null]},{"text":"Ich bin noch nie besiegt worden.","en":"I've never been defeated.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"still / yet"},{"g":"never, never at all"},null,{"g":"to become","l":"werden"}]},{"text":"Glaubst du, dass das Gute immer das Böse besiegt?","en":"Do you believe that good always triumphs over evil?","words":[{"g":"to believe something","l":"glauben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},{"g":"at all times without…"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"evil"},null]},{"text":"Tom wurde besiegt.","en":"Tom was defeated.","words":[null,{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},null]},{"text":"Wann und wo wurde Napoleon besiegt?","en":"When and where was Napoleon defeated?","words":[{"g":"when"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"where"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},null,null]}]}